Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:49.78,Source,,0,0,0,,Eurostat / Comisia Europeană — 2023
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,MAI RIDICATE RATE DE MORTALITATE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:05.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,RUTIERĂ DIN UNIUNEA EUROPEANĂ
